ask_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/645", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"who were the first people in the world?\", \"response\": \"The first people in the world are generally believed to have originated from Africa, specifically from a region in East Africa called the Horn of Africa. The earliest known human remains have been found in the region of Ethiopia and date back to around 2.5 million years ago.\\n\\nThe first humans were nomadic and lived a simple life, hunting and gathering food from the natural environment. They were mainly apelike in appearance and had not yet developed the ability to walk fully upright. Over time, they evolved into more advanced species of humans, such as Homo erectus, who were fully bipedal and had larger brains.\\n\\nAs these early humans spread out from Africa into other parts of the world, they encountered different environments and adapted to them, eventually settling in different regions and becoming the first inhabitants of those areas. This process of migration and settlement continued over thousands of years, and eventually, humans settled in every corner of the globe.\\n\\nToday, we know that there were many different groups of early humans, each with their own unique cultural and linguistic traditions, and that their stories are complex and fascinating. The study of human evolution and the history of our species is an ongoing area of research and discovery for scientists and historians alike.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/12", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Got any creative ideas for a 10 year old’s birthday?\", \"response\": \"Sure, here are some creative ideas for a 10-year-old's birthday:\\n\\n1. Have a themed party: Choose a theme that your child is interested in, such as superheroes, dinosaurs, or unicorns, and decorate the party space accordingly. You can also incorporate the theme into the party activities and food.\\n\\n2. Plan a day trip: Take your child and their friends on a fun day trip to a local amusement park, zoo, or museum.\\n\\n3. Host a movie night: Choose a popular movie that your child and their friends will enjoy, and set up a projector in your backyard or living room. Serve movie-themed snacks and treats.\\n\\n4. Plan a baking party: Have your child and their friends bake a special birthday treat, such as cupcakes or cookies. Provide them with the 